    "detailed_description": "<strong>Explore a cute '90s console RPG from the inside out as marooned cosmic magical girl, Mack. Battle and befriend an adorable menagerie of beasties via turn-based combat and personalized story sequences. Power up, pummel bosses, redesign dungeons, and hatch an escape plan from this game-within-a-game.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916660/extras/e7a6c4244bd8ff4122c29b6b6a44476f.webp?t=1715035037\" width=168 height=42 /></span><br>Traditional turn-based RPG combat with a twist. Luck favors the quick, but turn order is never predictable or guaranteed. Perform devastating combos and comebacks when the turns align, and unlock the true potential of your abilities on enhanced turns.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916660/extras/472bd76e6a3a8a7c9a5d1b7a006d6951.poster.avif?t=1715035037\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916660/extras/472bd76e6a3a8a7c9a5d1b7a006d6951.webm?t=1715035037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916660/extras/2031bbfd898ae65db8b09e454d2e310e.webp?t=1715035037\" width=201 height=42 /></span><br>Befriend &amp; recruit enemies organically, via unlockable and personalized story sequences. Any beastie can be your bestie.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916660/extras/2353078467eb196de242a7720f72ab05.poster.avif?t=1715035037\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916660/extras/2353078467eb196de242a7720f72ab05.webm?t=1715035037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916660/extras/03d7d6773611ccfc05bffdf59b5cc790.webp?t=1715035037\" width=131 height=50 /></span><br>One currency, many vectors of progression. Experience points, ability points, and gold pieces in one. Twinkle points can do it all! Don't spend them all in one place.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916660/extras/afc5db87c063083055c3c0dc0f4f507c.poster.avif?t=1715035037\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916660/extras/afc5db87c063083055c3c0dc0f4f507c.webm?t=1715035037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916660/extras/1397a44b3e77bdb91d053765ef98ceca.webp?t=1715035037\" width=280 height=50 /></span><br>Learn dozens of uniquely shaped combat abilities and configure them on the Ability Opus. Develop powerful enhancement boons in every slot!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916660/extras/dd6ac2b0d01ef42e6eb9af5dbc6c4999.poster.avif?t=1715035037\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916660/extras/dd6ac2b0d01ef42e6eb9af5dbc6c4999.webm?t=1715035037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Free field exploration with no random encounters.<br></li><li>Unique nondeterministic turn-based battle system.<br></li><li>One currency, many vectors of progression.<br></li><li>Adorable menagerie of befriendable enemies.<br></li><li>Innovative shape-based ability loadout and enhancement system.</li></ul>",
